      "function": "mrb_ary_splice",
      "line": null,
      "code": "if (alen < len || alen < tail) {\n  len = alen - head;\n}",
      "note": "Root cause fixed by the patch. When the requested slice extends past the array end, this block clamps `len` but leaves `tail` at its earlier value `head + original_len`; the fix adds `tail = head + len` here so later move arithmetic uses the clamped endpoint.",
      "kind": "root_cause_function"
    },
    {
